{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53386","headline":"山庄早春连雨即事 · 朱千乘","name":"山庄早春连雨即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崇朝竟日雨{风衰}{风衰}（疑），万物萌牙春（疑）水灾。\n白屋世情轻席户，青山老大厌莓苔。\n常时杨柳烟中绽，今岁花枝雪未开。\n节往始知阳气晚，和风不借後亭梅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱千乘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}